+    gpt-5.6-sol via codex, round-4 breadth campaign,
+    results/outer_loop_fable5_s5i5_probe.json): directly cracks round 3''s
+    "E/9 and C/9 couplings" deadlock. L5: temporarily grow E through the
+    upper F-wall gap to lift the 9 rail; once the attached 1-column
+    retracts above the isolated F block, 9 can retract four horizontal
+    bands past C, E retracts, C lowers the narrow diamond carrier below
+    both F walls, and E regrows into the lower socket. Fresh-reset
+    reproduce() passed on the exact 202-action prefix with reached_level=6
+    (L5+L6 both self-gate-verified). L6 adds active small-glyph 90-degree
+    joint rotators above telescoping controls (a three-link telescoping
+    arm): folding the E/B/9 arm into E-left, B-down, 9-right routes it
+    through the wall corridor. L7 is a four-link articulated maze plus a
+    separate A/8 clearance coupling: B-down, E-left along row 40, a
+    temporarily-horizontal 9 segment past the x=15 wall, then 9-up through
+    the x=6-8 gap and C-right reaches the socket -- won live at session
+    step 431 (the exact 311-action from-reset candidate is the artifact''s
+    full action_sequence). The source agent''s own reproduction_verified is
+    correctly reported false for the OVERALL claim (gating the full
+    311-action L7 line would have exceeded the 700-call budget on top of
+    the already-verified L5/L6 gate), but the outer loop independently
+    verified the L7 claim regardless: 5x fresh env.reset() + replay via a
+    new resolver priority branch, all 5 confirmed level=7,
+    state=GameState.NOT_FINISHED. L8 was scouted (a movable upper carriage
+    with 9-vertical/7-horizontal controls, the E diamond carrier, and a
+    B-rotated chamber cross) but not solved -- decoded the coupled
+    controls with the residual budget, stopped at 670/700 total calls with
+    30 remaining, insufficient for a solve attempt or gate. Frontier stays
+    at level 7.'
